# Model card for tsync2 (medium)

* Language: th_TH (Thai, Thailand)
* Speakers: 1
* Quality: medium
* Samplerate: 22,050Hz

## Dataset

* URL: https://huggingface.co/datasets/dubbing-ai/vaja-thai (`tsync2` config)
* License: CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 (**non-commercial**)
* Original corpus: NECTEC TSync2, "An Intensive Design of a Thai Speech Synthesis Corpus" (SNLP 2007)

## Training

Finetuned from the LibriTTS-R base model (MRD and SDP).

Requires Piper 1.8 or higher.

